  triage:snippet "raw = payload.get(\"reader_lanes\") -- fixed at 56cfd142b: the doctor JSON now emits the top-level reader_lanes key this parser expects; _parse_effective_lane_settings correctly fails closed (ReadBenchmarkError) when the key is absent, verified directly in code by req-qa (ATM-QA-101 minor follow-up filed only for a missing negative-path unit test pinning that fail-closed branch, non-blocking, routed to arch-ctm)." ;
  triage:status "fixed" ;
  triage:closed true ;
  triage:branch "chore/readiness-candidate-1.4.7" ;
  triage:headSha "56cfd142b" ;
